---
title: Intake conditional assistance · widen once, restate once, or block
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant code as Intake code
  participant jev as Jev
  participant sol as GPT-6.1 Sol

  code->>jev: batched questions · base routing context
  jev-->>code: typed answers
  opt a required fact stays unresolved
    code->>jev: widened once · omitted overview sections + replied-to messages
    jev-->>code: typed answers
    opt still unresolved
      code->>sol: restate what the batch reports or asks for
      sol-->>code: restatement
      code->>jev: once more · restatement as labeled context
      jev-->>code: typed answers
    end
  end
  alt every required fact resolved
    code->>code: commit one route
  else Sol cannot interpret, or still unresolved
    code->>code: commit routing_blocked · never fabricated noise
  end
